sequenceDiagram
    participant TS as Task Scheduler
    participant VM as startup_vm.ps1
    participant PX as startup_px.ps1
    participant Apps as startup_apps.ps1

    TS->>VM: boot + 30s
    VM->>VM: iniciar Multipass / VM ia-lab
    VM->>VM: sincronizar SSH
    TS->>Apps: logon + 20s
    Apps->>PX: iniciar / validar PX
    Apps->>VM: revalidar VM e SSH
